{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼これなーんだ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーロちゃんだあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかのことを「会長」って\n呼んでいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かたいなー笑 良いけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会 会長こと\n伊藤万理華です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃきん\nまじめにゆるく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血液型占いって信じる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝見て、内容忘れちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＨＤ４はまだあるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー！リーダーゆったんで笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性に連れて行ってほしい\nデートスポットは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こだわりないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶらりするだけとか←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスリッパは普段でも\n履いているの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"履いてるよーあったかいよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日レッスン後、\nらりんとまとせいたんまひろちはる\nひなちまひなぴょんまあや私で\nご飯食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人数。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パスタおいしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかいさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3039771/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\nでは、明日もがんばりまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}